## 6. Known deviations (documented, behavior-preserving)

- Same-device present(): host-side present-mode next_chain walk now happens
  before scheduleFrames instead of after (pure host-side struct mutation; the
  mutated pPresentModes are only consumed at QueuePresentKHR time). GPU submit
  order, semaphores, values, fences identical to pre-change.
- Same-device present(): capture blit recording now precedes scheduleFrames
  (recording is host-side; submission order unchanged). If the 150 ms fence
  wait then throws, the capture cmdbuf is left in recording state — equal
  looseness to the pre-existing mid-present throw paths; no recovery path
  reuses the buffer without swapchain recreation.
